</div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_zoomIn zoomIn vision-box" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p>The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering (EEE) at Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam University, Indore, offers a dynamic learning environment focused on electrical machines, power systems, control systems, and electronics. The department prepares students for diverse careers in the energy, automation, manufacturing, and electronics sectors. With a strong emphasis on practical learning, research orientation, and interdisciplinary training, IEEE graduates are equipped to meet the demands of the evolving energy and automation landscape.</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div></div></div>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element mission-box" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<h4>Key Highlights of the Department</h4>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>🔹Balanced focus on electrical core and modern electronics applications.<br />
🔹Faculty with specialization in power systems, renewable energy, and control engineering.<br />
🔹Workshops and training programs in solar power, IoT, automation, and MATLAB.<br />
🔹State-of-the-art labs for machines, power electronics, control systems, and PLC/SCADA.<br />
🔹Strong industry interface for live projects, industrial visits, and expert lectures.<br />
🔹MoUs with renewable energy firms and automation companies for internships.<br />
🔹Focus on energy-efficient systems and smart grid technologies.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>

		</div>
	</div>
</div></div><div class="vc_tta-panel" id="1750742984608-e7040b2b-79e7" data-vc-content=".vc_tta-panel-body"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title"><a href="#1750742984608-e7040b2b-79e7" data-vc-accordion data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Vision &amp; Mission</span></a></h4></div><div class="vc_tta-panel-body"><h2 style="text-align: center" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading" >Vision</h2><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_inner vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
